MapOpModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Maps the SIR op space to the IR op space: Core.Equals to IR.StructEqu, Core.Lit to IR.Lit, Core.* names are renamed to IR.* (with exceptions), Ctrl.Call/Sys.*/Mem.* are preserved. Returns the IR op string.
    Provides: MapOp(op) -> irop.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../MapOp/MapOp.sir).
